  m_Name: MarkBeesly_Log01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LogData
  subject: G-Safe hydraulic systems down
  log: I
  date: May 30th, 20XX
  author: Mark Beesly
  message: 'Was called at 2am by manager. 3 days before Orpheus launch. Maintenance
    time: 6 hours. Issue: poorly installed and poorly fit hydraulic pumps, negligence.
    Replaced. Got yelled at by manager anyways. Grit my teeth and took it. I really
    need this job to keep food on the table for my family. Was called at 2am by manager.
